MousePods
https://github.com/starman-tech/mousepods
Copyright Matteo Gaudioso
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Derived portions:
  - src/core/head_tracking.rs: attitude integration, gravity reference frame,
    and gyro-bias estimation, following MousePods' MotionEngine.step.
  - src/system/head_mouse/: head-mouse dynamics and pointer behaviour informed
    by MousePods' Linux head-mouse implementation.
  - src/core/aacp/remotehid.rs and src/core/aacp/rtbuddy.rs: Apple RemoteHID
    (HID over AACP) framing and sensor bring-up, following MousePods'
    docs/REMOTEHID-PROTOCOL.md and capture scripts, including the
    request_all_descriptors sequence and the L2CAP receive MTU requirement.

